### ================================================================
### gps-sync.http — 대시보드 테스트 (전체 HTTP 방식)
###
### 목적: 그룹 알람 생성 → MOVING → ACTIVE → 대시보드 확인
###
### 사전 준비:
###   1. Run with: prod 선택 (baseUrl = https://gonow-api.uk)
###   2. STEP 1 실행 후 순서대로 진행
###
### ================================================================


### ================================================================
### STEP 1. 로그인
### ================================================================

### 1-1. 방장(a@gmail.com) 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "a@gmail.com",
  "password": "a1234"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("hostToken", response.body.data.access_token);
    client.global.set("hostMemberId", response.body.data.member_id);
%}

### 1-2. 참여자(b@gmail.com) 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "b@gmail.com",
  "password": "b1234"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("guestToken", response.body.data.access_token);
%}


### ================================================================
### STEP 2. 그룹 알람 생성 (방장)
### ================================================================

### 2-1. 오늘 날짜 + 2시간 후 target_time으로 그룹 알람 생성
< {%
    const today = new Date();
    const pad = n => String(n).padStart(2, '0');
    const dateStr = `${today.getFullYear()}-${pad(today.getMonth()+1)}-${pad(today.getDate())}`;
    const later = new Date(today.getTime() + 2 * 60 * 60 * 1000);
    const laterStr = `${later.getFullYear()}-${pad(later.getMonth()+1)}-${pad(later.getDate())}T${pad(later.getHours())}:${pad(later.getMinutes())}:00`;
    client.global.set("today", dateStr);
    client.global.set("laterTarget", laterStr);
%}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}

{
  "title": "대시보드 테스트",
  "plan_date": "{{today}}",
  "target_time": "{{laterTarget}}",
  "dest_name": "건국대학교 서울캠퍼스",
  "dest_address": "서울 광진구 능동로 120",
  "dest_lat": 37.54353,
  "dest_lng": 127.07741,
  "transport_type": "TRANSIT"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("appointmentId", response.body.data.appointment_id);
    client.global.set("inviteCode", response.body.data.invite_code);
%}


### ================================================================
### STEP 3. 참여자 초대코드로 참여
### ================================================================

### 3-1. 참여자(b) 초대코드로 참여
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/join
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}

{
  "invite_code": "{{inviteCode}}",
  "transport_type": "TRANSIT"
}


### ================================================================
### STEP 4. DEPARTING 유도 (target_time을 현재+1분으로 수정)
### ================================================================

### 4-1. target_time 현재+1분으로 수정
< {%
    const today = new Date();
    const pad = n => String(n).padStart(2, '0');
    const dateStr = `${today.getFullYear()}-${pad(today.getMonth()+1)}-${pad(today.getDate())}`;
    const soon = new Date(today.getTime() + 1 * 60 * 1000);
    const soonStr = `${soon.getFullYear()}-${pad(soon.getMonth()+1)}-${pad(soon.getDate())}T${pad(soon.getHours())}:${pad(soon.getMinutes())}:00`;
    client.global.set("today", dateStr);
    client.global.set("soonTarget", soonStr);
%}
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}

{
  "plan_date": "{{today}}",
  "target_time": "{{soonTarget}}",
  "dest_name": "건국대학교 서울캠퍼스",
  "dest_address": "서울 광진구 능동로 120",
  "dest_lat": 37.54353,
  "dest_lng": 127.07741,
  "transport_type": "TRANSIT"
}


### ================================================================
### STEP 5. 참여자 좌표 전송 → DEPARTING
### ================================================================

### 5-1. 참여자(b) 현재 위치 좌표 전송 → DEPARTING (P>=Q 조건)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/participants/location
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}

{
  "lat": 37.50257,
  "lng": 126.95324
}

### ★ 응답에서 participant_status=DEPARTING 확인


### ================================================================
### STEP 6. 300m 이탈 → MOVING → appointment_status=ACTIVE
### ================================================================

### 6-1. 참여자(b) 300m 이탈 좌표 → MOVING → ACTIVE
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/participants/location
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}

{
  "lat": 37.49960,
  "lng": 126.95324
}

### ★ 응답에서 participant_status=MOVING, appointment_status=ACTIVE 확인
### ★ 앱에서 대시보드 버튼 활성화 확인 → 터치하면 대시보드 열림
### ★ 대시보드에서 ETA 표시 확인


### ================================================================
### STEP 7. 대시보드 API 직접 조회
### ================================================================

### 7-1. 방장(a)으로 대시보드 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}

### 7-2. 참여자(b)로 대시보드 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
